<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech IPB head stake selloff by end-summer.</title>
<headline>Czech IPB head stake selloff by end-summer.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sale of the state's 36 percent stake in Czech bank IPB a.s. to Japan's Nomura should be completed by the end of the summer, the CTK news agency quoted bank Director Jiri Tesar as saying on Thursday.</p>
</text>
